      {
        "name": "places/ChIJi14PBwD_AzQRG1ewfMOpCaA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21jM1NIVmxRVGRmWTFNMFMyMUhUM2R1YVRCNFFWRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "食物很美味，老闆也很友善。我無意中聽到她和另一位顧客聊天，說她會仔細考慮顧客的喜好、選用哪些食材，以及如何讓食物更美味。她也提到，她盡力堅持所有食材都從零開始製作，而不是使用市售產品。\n\n雖然餐廳位置可能有點偏僻，但我每次去都覺得很溫馨舒適。這裡已經成為我最喜歡的地方了❤️",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "The food is quite nice & the owner is friendly. I overheard her talking with another customer about how she thinks through what customers would like, what ingredients to use, & how to make her food tastier. She also mentioned how she tries her best to make everything from scratch instead of store bought items.\nIt may be located in a weird area but I feel warm & welcomed every time I go. My new favourite place ❤️",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
